                "text": "When water waves travel from a deep part to a shallow part, the wavelength decreases as illustrated in Figure 1.18. However, the frequency of the waves does not change. Since velocity, v, is given by \\(f\\lambda\\), the velocity of the waves decreases with decrease in wavelength.",
